WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.146
"What a mess!" Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

2
00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:16.952
Peter and Benjamin looked up.

3
00:00:16.953 --> 00:00:20.284
"Mrs. Tiggywinkle!" Peter said.

4
00:00:20.285 --> 00:00:27.736
"You're back!" Benjamin said.

5
00:00:27.737 --> 00:00:37.055
Mrs. Tiggywinkle put on her apron and cap.

6
00:00:37.056 --> 00:00:40.562
"Benjamin, mop this floor.

7
00:00:40.563 --> 00:00:42.854
Peter, pick up that laundry.

8
00:00:42.855 --> 00:00:48.010
I will show you how to wash clothes."

9
00:00:48.011 --> 00:00:57.641
First, Mrs. Tiggywinkle heated some water.

10
00:00:57.642 --> 00:01:00.442
Next, she put in some soap.

11
00:01:00.443 --> 00:01:06.384
"Just a little bit," she said.

12
00:01:06.385 --> 00:01:10.029
"Now it's time to scrub."

13
00:01:10.030 --> 00:01:17.846
The bunnies scrubbed the clothes.

14
00:01:17.847 --> 00:01:21.308
They hung them on a line.

15
00:01:21.309 --> 00:01:24.075
"All clean!" Peter said.

16
00:01:24.076 --> 00:01:27.786
"Let's go play!" Benjamin said.

17
00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:30.179
Mrs. Tiggywinkle frowned.

18
00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:33.214
"Not yet," she said.

19
00:01:33.215 --> 00:01:42.257
"We must wash Flopsy's red dress first."

20
00:01:42.258 --> 00:01:48.595
At last all the laundry was done.

21
00:01:48.596 --> 00:01:51.644
The house was clean.

22
00:01:51.645 --> 00:02:05.613
"Now you can play," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

23
00:02:05.614 --> 00:02:13.002
Peter and Benjamin walked home slowly.

24
00:02:13.003 --> 00:02:16.562
They got Benjamin's kite.

25
00:02:16.563 --> 00:02:24.304
Then they went to a field.

26
00:02:24.305 --> 00:02:29.094
Benjamin yawned.

27
00:02:29.095 --> 00:02:32.800
"You can fly the kite first," he said.

28
00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:40.337
But Peter was snoring!

29
00:02:40.338 --> 00:02:49.200
Soon Benjamin was snoring too.

